NOTICE

This repository is derived from the National Health and Nutrition Examination
Survey (NHANES), public-use files for the 2015-2016 and 2017-2018 cycles,
published by the National Center for Health Statistics (NCHS), Centers for
Disease Control and Prevention (CDC), United States.

Source: https://wwwn.cdc.gov/nchs/nhanes/

NHANES data are de-identified public-use data. No respondent-level record is
redistributed here; the repository contains task definitions, aggregate
reference values, scoring code, figures, and model outputs. NCHS/CDC has not
reviewed and does not endorse this repository or the conclusions of the
accompanying manuscript.

Model outputs were generated by the model providers listed in the manuscript and
are released for research use. The model weights are not redistributed.
